    "%@后会达到 %lld 张，因此本次不会导入任何新素材。升级 ReelFlow Pro 可解锁无限图片导入，并移除导出水印。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@后会达到 %2$lld 张，因此本次不会导入任何新素材。升级 ReelFlow Pro 可解锁无限图片导入，并移除导出水印。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This would bring the total to %lld photos after %@, so no new assets will be imported this time. Upgrade to ReelFlow Pro to unlock unlimited photo imports and remove the export watermark."
          }
